Package: doubletrs
Title: Memory-Efficient Doublet Detection for Single-Cell RNA Sequencing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mayank", "Gandhi", email = "135.mayankgandhi@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "cph",
      comment = "see inst/AUTHORS for the bundled crates, their authors and licenses")
  )
Description: Detects doublets in single-cell RNA sequencing data with the
    'DoubletFinder' method of McGinnis, Murrow and Gartner (2019)
    <doi:10.1016/j.cels.2019.03.003>, implemented in 'Rust' to use less
    memory and time. Provides artificial doublet simulation, exact
    nearest-neighbour search and pANN (proportion of artificial nearest
    neighbours) scoring, and reproduces 'DoubletFinder' scores exactly.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mayankgandhi13/doublet-rs
BugReports: https://github.com/mayankgandhi13/doublet-rs/issues
